    "chunk_text": "However the parliamentary Opposition has not been able to capitalise on suffering of the people. Even today,\u00a0 while malnutrition stalks the land and wages are not keeping pace with the rising cost of living, parties in opposition are taking up the issue of the retirement age of judges in the country!\n\nHowever,\u00a0 this situation could change overnight if the government does not take meaningful steps to control the cost of living. The signs of things to come are plainly to be seen. Groups of workers are threatening strike action. The overnment needs to take corrective action urgently."
