    "description": "UK government rejects \u2019kill switch\u2019 idea for dangerous AI",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/UK-government-rejects-kill-switch-idea-for-dangerous-AI/107-350160",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1789225467.0,
